# Four subjects in a grid of rows and columns (2 x 2): without direction more than three subjects no longer all
# stand below each other when actors join several systems. Columns behave as side by side, with lanes for actors
# between them, rows as below each other.
diagram usecase "Stadtwerke" subtitle="Vier Systeme im Raster" locale=de
actor kunde "Kundin"
actor service "Servicemitarbeiter"
actor techniker "Techniker"
actor bank "Bank" kind=system
subject portal "Kundenportal"
usecase zaehler "Zählerstand melden" in portal
usecase vertrag "Vertrag einsehen" in portal
subject crm "CRM"
usecase anfrage "Anfrage bearbeiten" in crm
usecase tarif "Tarif wechseln" in crm
subject abrechnung "Abrechnung"
usecase rechnung "Rechnung erstellen" in abrechnung
usecase lastschrift "Lastschrift einziehen" in abrechnung
subject netz "Netzbetrieb"
usecase stoerung "Störung beheben" in netz
usecase ablesen "Zähler ablesen" in netz
rel kunde -- zaehler source=1 card=0..*
rel kunde -- vertrag
rel kunde -- tarif
rel service -- anfrage
rel service -- tarif
rel service -- rechnung source=1..* card=0..*
rel lastschrift -- bank
rel techniker -- stoerung
rel techniker -- ablesen
rel rechnung --> lastschrift include
